    <item>
      <title>Mamata Banerjee: নোটিস ধরাতে মমতার বাড়িতে দমকলবাহিনী</title>
      <link>https://bengali.abplive.com/district/fire-department-send-notice-to-mamata-banerjees-kalighat-house-around-abhishek-banerjee-s-office-related-issue-breaking-news-1199623</link>
